        "text": "### Result\n{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"events\": [\n    \"mousedown\",\n    \"mousemove\",\n    \"mouseup\"\n  ],\n  \"message\": \"Drag simulated from center-right to center-left\"\n}\n### Ran Playwright code\n```js\nawait page.evaluate('() => {\\n  // Test rotating the panorama by simulating a drag\\n  const viewer = document.querySelector(\\'[data-semtag-id=\"panorama.viewer\"]\\');\\n  if (!viewer) return { error: \\'Panorama viewer not found\\' };\\n  \\n  // Get the bounding rect\\n  const rect = viewer.getBoundingClientRect();\\n  const centerX = rect.left + rect.width / 2;\\n  const centerY = rect.top + rect.height / 2;\\n  \\n  // Simulate a drag from right to left (rotating left)\\n  const dragDistance = 200;\\n  \\n  const events = [];\\n  \\n  // Mouse down at center\\n  const mouseDownEvent = new MouseEvent(\\'mousedown\\', {\\n    bubbles: true,\\n    cancelable: true,\\n    clientX: centerX,\\n    clientY: centerY\\n  });\\n  viewer.dispatchEvent(mouseDownEvent);\\n  events.push(\\'mousedown\\');\\n  \\n  // Mouse move left\\n  const mouseMoveEvent = new MouseEvent(\\'mousemove\\', {\\n    bubbles: true,\\n    cancelable: true,\\n    clientX: centerX - dragDistance,\\n    clientY: centerY\\n  });\\n  viewer.dispatchEvent(mouseMoveEvent);\\n  events.push(\\'mousemove\\');\\n  \\n  // Mouse up\\n  const mouseUpEvent = new MouseEvent(\\'mouseup\\', {\\n    bubbles: true,\\n    cancelable: true\\n  });\\n  viewer.dispatchEvent(mouseUpEvent);\\n  events.push(\\'mouseup\\');\\n  \\n  return { \\n    success: true, \\n    events, \\n    message: \\'Drag simulated from center-right to center-left\\' \\n  };\\n}');\n```"
